# Sysbuild Kconfig of the zephyr_app (NCS v3.3.0).
#
# MCUboot goes in on the boards carrying the nRF54LM20A: the pod board of
# the project and the nRF54LM20 DK it is developed on. Both leave 920 KB per
# image slot (zephyr/dts/vendor/nordic/nrf54lm20a_cpuapp_partition.dtsi).
#
# The default below comes before the source line on purpose: in a choice the
# first default that applies wins, and the one of Zephyr (BOOTLOADER_NONE)
# would win otherwise.

choice BOOTLOADER
	default BOOTLOADER_MCUBOOT if BOARD_NRF54LM20DK || BOARD_PMBOARD
endchoice

source "share/sysbuild/Kconfig"
